------------------------------- MODULE SmallSystem -------------------------------

EXTENDS Naturals, FiniteSets

CONSTANTS D

VARIABLES x

F[1] == 2
F[n \in {2,3,4}] == F[n-1] + 1
F[5] == 1

N[1](x) == (x = 1) => 2
N[2](x) == (x = 2) => 3
N[3](x) == (x = 3) => 4

Init == x \in {1,2,3,4,5}

Next ==
    \/ /\ x' = F[x]
    \/ /\ \E i \in {1,2,3} : x' = N[i](x)

Spec ==
    Init /\ [][Next]_<<x>>

Inv ==
    \A x \in {1,2,3,4,5} : (x < 5 => F[x] = x + 1) /\ (x = 5 => F[x] = 1)

================================================================================